67,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Efficiency and peace of mind are the priorities here. Option B is the most rational solution to avoid further friction.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
