69,3,2,talk,Victoria,,I am glad we found a solution that addresses both the reliability of the car and the stress of the administration. It feels like the right balance for us.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
