71,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I'm relieved we've found a way to ensure financial fairness without creating a stressful environment. It's the most sustainable path for all of us.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
