73,3,2,talk,Minato,,I'm so happy we all agree! It feels like we're taking care of each other. I'm glad we can stop worrying and just be friends. I vote for B too!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
